<h2>About These Sessions</h2>

<p>Our sessions at Da Nang Marriott Resort & Spa are led by Jenny, Seb and Amy, drawing on the same authentic training and approach that runs through everything at Inner Flowing. Whether you are a complete beginner or an experienced practitioner, you will find something here that meets you where you are.</p>

<div class="shared-story">
<p><strong>Hatha Yoga & Sound Healing</strong> - therapeutic Yoga combined with the vibrational resonance of Tibetan singing bowls and crystal bowls, guided by Jenny and/or Amy.</p>
<p><strong>Qigong & Sound Healing</strong> - unique lineage Qigong led by Seb with high precision - a style of practice many practitioners will never have encountered elsewhere - with Jenny and Amy weaving in therapeutic sound. These sessions are designed to be genuinely health-giving, simultaneously energising and deeply calming, with results you can feel in your body from the very first session.</p>
<p><strong>Yin Yoga & Sound Healing</strong> - long-held postures working deep into the connective tissue, accompanied by Sound Healing, guided by Jenny and/or Amy.</p>
</div>

